# Sounds directory
#
# Bundled sound files (e.g., default notification tones that ship with
# the app). The user's custom sound files (uploaded via the
# AddMedicationModal) are NOT stored here — they are kept as base64
# data URLs in localStorage on the user's device.
#
# This directory is reserved for future use if we want to ship default
# MP3/WAV ringtones instead of (or alongside) the synthesized Web
# Audio sounds in src/utils/sound.ts.
